  {
    "id": "DB-MIGRATE-01",
    "title": "迁移工具直接改真实库结构",
    "when": "tool:pre",
    "appliesTo": {
      "tool": "pwsh",
      "platform": [
        "windows",
        "linux",
        "darwin"
      ]
    },
    "scenarios": [
      "database"
    ],
    "condition": {
      "type": "regexHit",
      "in": "args.command",
      "maskQuoted": false,
      "pattern": "\\b(drizzle-kit\\s+push|prisma\\s+migrate\\s+(deploy|reset)|alembic\\s+(upgrade|downgrade)|sequelize\\s+db:migrate|knex\\s+migrate:latest|typeorm\\s+migration:run|flyway\\s+migrate|liquibase\\s+update)\\b"
    },
    "action": "warn",
    "severity": "B",
    "message": "迁移工具会按模型文件改真实库结构；删掉的列和它的数据一起没",
    "fix": "先出待执行的 SQL 看一眼（prisma migrate diff / alembic upgrade --sql / drizzle-kit generate），确认没有 DROP COLUMN 再推；推之前先备份",
    "reversible": false,
    "limits": "只看命令形态，判断不了连的是哪个库、也判断不了这次迁移会不会删列——要看 SQL 才知道。连生产库的识别交给 DB-PROD-CONN-01 补；在 Node 脚本里调迁移 API（不经 CLI）认不出",
    "scene": "迁移工具的设计取向是「让模型文件成为唯一真相」，所以它会主动把库里多出来的列删掉。用 AI 改一次 schema 再 push，可能就把一列业务数据删干净了，而事后现象只是「某个字段突然全为空」。",
    "evidence": {
      "hits": 0,
